            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Restorative Ritual Tradition",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>Traditional wellness systems have long associated brahmi with contemplative sensory environments and restorative ritual practices.</p><p>Its calming botanical profile aligns naturally with slower nighttime rituals.</p>",
