            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Sensory Atmosphere",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>Brahmi contributes atmospheric softness and grounded calm within ritual formulations.</p><p>Its presence supports slower transitions and gentler sensory pacing during ritual use.</p>",
