            "title": "Botanical Integration",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p>Layered formulations allow botanical extracts, oils, and aromatic compounds to function together rather than in isolation.</p><p>Within Mirellis formulations, brahmi supports sensory harmony and formulation balance.</p>",
